{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51690","headline":"金鸡石（在东流县南二十五里。相传罗隐道经其地，题云云，石遂迸裂，鷄飞鸣而去。或曰：隐题後，其石震雷劈焉。） · 罗隐","name":"金鸡石（在东流县南二十五里。相传罗隐道经其地，题云云，石遂迸裂，鷄飞鸣而去。或曰：隐题後，其石震雷劈焉。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青山隐隐望长溪，独墩无伴只孤栖。\n草堂不见娄罗汉，金鸡不向五更啼。\n（同上卷一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51690.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51690","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}